### Basic routes
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Read all
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions

### Query parameter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions?type=expense

### Route parameter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/1

### Summary
GET http://localhost:3000/api/summary

### Create: request body + 201 Created
POST http://localhost:3000/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 300,
  "category": "Transport",
  "note": "Bus fare",
  "date": "2026-10-03"
}

### Replace all fields: PUT
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 350,
  "category": "Transport",
  "note": "Taxi fare",
  "date": "2026-10-03"
}

### Change selected fields: PATCH
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Shared taxi fare"
}

### Delete: 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/3

### Missing resource: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:3000/api/transactions/999
